OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed over 1989 murder of    
OL,4,Ajeweller in flat                       
OL,6,FA 64-year-old man arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder over the death of a jeweller 
OL,8,F37 years ago has been released on      
OL,9,Fpolice bail.                           
OL,11,FRichard Haywood, known as Ricky, was   
OL,12,Fshot multiple times in his flat above  
OL,13,FAmbiance Jewellers on Shirley Road,    
OL,14,FSouthampton on 16 October 1989.        
OL,16,FPolice said the arrested man from the  
OL,17,Fcity had been released on police bail  
OL,18,Funtil 24 February while further        
OL,19,Finquiries continue.                    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
