OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed over 1989 murder of    
OL,4,Ajeweller in flat                       
OL,6,FTo date no one has been charged with   
OL,7,Fthe 36-year-old's murder with the      
OL,8,Finvestigation reopened in 2024. Police 
OL,9,Fbelieve more than one person was       
OL,10,Finvolved and those responsible were at 
OL,11,Fthe jewellery shop on the day he was   
OL,12,Fshot and had threatened him.           
